  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"來自 Serilum 的模組。滿懷熱情製作。眾多適用於 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>無鞍騎馬（Bareback Horse Riding）讓玩家無需馬鞍即可騎馬。你可以帶著剛找到的馬匹一起走，而不必丟下牠，然後去翻地牢的箱子找馬鞍。預設情況下，騎乘無鞍的馬匹會讓玩家和馬匹獲得緩速效果。你也可以在設定中啟用每15秒受到一次傷害。穿上皮革褲子可以防止緩速/傷害，但每次抵消效果時會降低其耐久度。所有設定都可調整，功能也可自由開關。<br><br>馴服機制保持不變。馬匹只有在被馴服且友好後才能被操控方向。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：用戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>是否讓玩家（和馬匹）在騎乘無鞍馬匹時獲得緩速效果。<br><br><span><strong>shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false<br>是否讓玩家在騎乘無鞍馬匹時受到傷害。<br><br><span><strong>leatherPantsNegateEffect</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>是否讓皮革褲子防止玩家在騎乘無鞍馬匹時受到傷害或獲得緩速效果（若已啟用）。<br><br><span><strong>ticksBetweenDamage</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 300，最小值 1，最大值 72000<br>若啟用傷害，每間隔多少遊戲刻（tick）對玩家造成一次傷害。1秒 = 20 tick<br><br><span><strong>halfHeartDamageAmount</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 2，最小值 1，最大值 100<br>騎乘無鞍馬匹時對玩家造成的傷害量（半顆心為單位）。<br><br><span><strong>leatherPantsLoseDurabilityOnNegation</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>皮革褲子每次防止傷害時是否會損失耐久度。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>無需馬鞍即可騎乘馬匹：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>啟用 'shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 時會獲得緩速效果：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>或啟用 'shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 時會定期受到傷害：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>穿上皮革褲子可以防止緩速/傷害，但會消耗耐久度：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示隱藏內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載點仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
